{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down</strong> <strong>PvP / PvE</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ player <strong>dedicated servers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> the <strong>primal world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Loot</strong>, <strong>Craft</strong>, and <strong>Build</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit</strong> multiple survivors; skill up with <strong>new abilities</strong>, and <strong>specialize</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Science, Faith, Culture, and Combat</strong> progression trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer others</strong>\u00a0with your unique specializations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achieve Ascension</strong> to extract\u00a0<strong>from the world</strong>\u00a0with your defeated opponents' <strong>glory</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras/d9e41f29ab8e6f80038471dc7a623d46.avif?t=1773219173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras_big/d9e41f29ab8e6f80038471dc7a623d46.webp?t=1773219173 width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was only the <strong><i>primal, pain, predators</i></strong>, and those with the will to outlast them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are barefoot, alone, exposed. No map. No mission. Just wilderness - ancient, and hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you'll fight to stay warm. To not become something's lunch. Then, you'll rush to settle - to fortify, to grow your numbers, to raise defenses. And finally: to choose. Exist and endure - or to specialize and dominate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;There is no one way to victory, yet it is always forwards.&quot;</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras/ca0c5d48d7ca15df6d4a13b572bf10b2.avif?t=1773219173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras_big/ca0c5d48d7ca15df6d4a13b572bf10b2.webp?t=1773219173 width=1560 height=274 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wilderness wants you gone. So do the animals. So do the barbarians. So do the other players, most of the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survivors must eat, drink, sleep, stay warm, or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras/9e17ed4af7003328b17c9c171101a26b.avif?t=1773219173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras_big/9e17ed4af7003328b17c9c171101a26b.webp?t=1773219173 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm your survivors with handaxes, bows, simple spears, and, with enough skill, swords, crossbows or even explosives. Forge defenses with reinforced doors, towers, and siege gear. Mine and smelt ores to craft stronger equipment and extend your tribe\u2019s might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras/16df5620c1f8018d724baf6949daaec6.avif?t=1773219173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras_big/16df5620c1f8018d724baf6949daaec6.webp?t=1773219173 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every construction piece placed is a tactical decision. Every structure built is a home, a statement, a foothold, a safe haven, or a deception in stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras/4c8b32439b9e4ec9a060e7e954acc89e.avif?t=1773219173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras_big/4c8b32439b9e4ec9a060e7e954acc89e.webp?t=1773219173 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weak walls falter. Weak settlements fall. Weak strategies fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But place your trust in yourself, your allies, your architecture, your automated defenses, and above all - your foresight - and you may survive the night. Perhaps you'll even come to command the raiders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras/6da0c671c41306680b716b23cc83c8f0.avif?t=1773219173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras_big/6da0c671c41306680b716b23cc83c8f0.webp?t=1773219173 width=1560 height=274 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have achieved a domination, your tribe can <strong>Ascend</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascension</strong> wipes your survivors, settlements, and possessions, but grants <strong>Glory</strong>, your permanent ELO-like score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate</strong>, and your tribe\u2019s name rises in <strong>Glory</strong>. Fail, and you become part of someone else\u2019s legend.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895390?t=1773219173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895390?t=1773219173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/14cb4a5b2809de724bfb56bc972ab1d62b9860ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773219173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/14cb4a5b2809de724bfb56bc972ab1d62b9860ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773219173","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down</strong> <strong>PvP / PvE</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ player <strong>dedicated servers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> the <strong>primal world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Loot</strong>, <strong>Craft</strong>, and <strong>Build</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit</strong> multiple survivors; skill up with <strong>new abilities</strong>, and <strong>specialize</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Science, Faith, Culture, and Combat</strong> progression trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer others</strong>\u00a0with your unique specializations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achieve Ascension</strong> to extract\u00a0<strong>from the world</strong>\u00a0with your defeated opponents' <strong>glory</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras/d9e41f29ab8e6f80038471dc7a623d46.avif?t=1773219173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/extras_big/d9e41f29ab8e6f80038471dc7a623d46.webp?t=1773219173 width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was only the <strong