ses in <strong>Glory</strong>. Fail, and you become part of someone else\u2019s legend.</p>","developers":["Symbol Door"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895390/249d5ff2ba740cdda2d6ac18864fd0426eadd174/header.jpg?t=1773219173","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9\u202f\u202fSymbol Door Limited.\u202fAll\u202frights\u202freserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895390/1992196058/287a33dfdb1ce842a5d99d2de937b07a9b70ba1c/1761352122/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761390061","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895390/1992196058/287a33dfdb1ce842a5d99d2de937b07a9b70ba1c/1761352122/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761390061","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895390/1992196058/287a33dfdb1ce842a5d99d2de937b07a9b70ba1c/1761352122/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761390061","id":257222316,"name":"Wishlist Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222316/4b2ea83bb249088ac6c061e9488ad9e8ca75ffc9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761390061"}],"name":"Before","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Symbol Door"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","de